    "body": "> @graveljp did a lot of work in that area in #9537, while also integrating the idea of a \"current output bitmap\"\r\n\r\nJust looked over this, and it addresses on the main issue that I had in mind, namely, that the \"output bitmap\" concept needs to be more concrete at the canvas element level (since it's common to all of the rendering contexts).",
